Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.10,0:00:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Any luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.32,0:00:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Check Interpol and the\NSardinian police records.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.72,0:00:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you find any matching\Nsets of fingerprints?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.12,0:00:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but nothing's coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.18,0:00:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If there ever was a criminal record,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.02,0:00:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure the boss has had\Nit completely wiped by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.26,0:00:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.22,0:00:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain there must be something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.16,0:00:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Or else this makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.92,0:00:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,If his identity weren't at risk, why\Nelse would he target his own daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.08,0:00:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we go look through\Nthe city death records?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.48,0:00:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a possibility the boss\Nmight have faked his own death.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.68,0:00:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.32,0:00:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let him get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.94,0:00:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,For a moment, that feeling\Ncame over me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.72,0:00:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like in Venice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.44,0:00:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The person who approached\NAbacchio was my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.56,0:00:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I know he murdered Abacchio\Nusing us on two hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.92,0:00:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mean to say you can\Nsense his presence right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.98,0:00:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.89,0:01:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't tell you where exactly,\Nbut he's nearby. Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.46,0:01:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.76,0:01:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we fail to identify\Nand dispatch the boss in time,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.94,0:01:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,it will be our ugly heads that roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.64,0:01:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ascolta!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.55,0:01:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to locate him fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.94,0:01:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.38,0:01:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Still no matches.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.88,0:01:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.20,0:01:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's covered his tracks expertly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.00,0:01:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Miseria.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.91,0:01:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems we've hit a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.66,0:01:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.74,0:01:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You've already succeeded in\Nfinding your court. Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.70,0:01:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You need only learn\Nthe way to destroy him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.10,0:01:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And start
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.82,0:02:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that? To you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.24,0:02:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,To you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.84,0:02:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.32,0:02:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.38,0:02:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.80,0:03:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for so long,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.10,0:03:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,so long for ones like you to hunt\Ndown this vile, this Despicable man!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.18,0:03:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonah, we're being tracked!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.76,0:03:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly, cut the communication!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.34,0:03:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.25,0:03:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.17,0:03:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.08,0:03:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you wish to defeat Diablo?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.20,0:03:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Diablo?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.66,0:03:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.46,0:03:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always had hope that a hero with the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.58,0:03:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,strength to slay Diablo\Nwould one day appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.12,0:03:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I've kept a\Nclose watch on this line.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.10,0:03:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So many arduous years of doubt and anxiety\NI braved, all in wait of your arrival.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.56,0:03:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I am on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.96,0:03:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Diavolo, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.72,0:03:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive my weariness,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.24,0:03:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,but it will take a whole\Nlot more than simply
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.08,0:03:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,knowing a name to convince\Nme you're trustworthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.88,0:04:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno, please disconnect us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.40,0:04:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I also know his stand has the\Npower to travel through time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.70,0:04:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But you knew that as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.06,0:04:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Which, I would dare to wager,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.36,0:04:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,is exactly why you're scrambling to\Nuncover this man's true identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.04,0:04:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He is on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.78,0:04:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He's trying to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.24,0:04:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No underling of my father could\Nknow all this and still be alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.54,0:04:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec, Trish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.62,0:04:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We really don't want to risk\Nshowing our hand too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.60,0:04:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, we'll hear you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.54,0:04:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please start by telling us your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.58,0:04:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not something you need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.90,0:04:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no longer in any physical\Ncondition to engage in combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.24,0:04:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,All that matters is whether you\Nare able to beat this monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.06,0:04:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,His ability to distort time\Nitself has no weakness, Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.92,0:04:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,As things stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.20,0:04:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,if your ultimate goal is to eliminate him\Nfor good, then you are doomed to fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.44,0:04:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm assuming that you know the secret\Nto defeating him once and for all?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.38,0:04:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Emperor Crimson is virtually invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.08,0:05:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But yes, there is a way you might\Nstill stand a chance, a slim one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.38,0:05:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And you will have no other\Nchoice but to obtain it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.32,0:05:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.36,0:05:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You must come meet me\Nhere, in the city of Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.54,0:05:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Only then will I be able to\Nshow you the path to victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.14,0:05:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really demanding\Npersonal visits already?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.20,0:05:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We've only just met.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.22,0:05:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain at least some of\Nyou are familiar with this item.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.90,0:05:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.26,0:05:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.66,0:05:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.80,0:05:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,How did it come to be in your possession?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.52,0:05:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll gladly share this story,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.56,0:05:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,but only once you've come to\Nretrieve it and not a second before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.82,0:05:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even he knows the\Ntrue way to use the arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.92,0:05:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Its powers extend beyond simply\Nawakening one's standard ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.48,0:05:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It bears a hidden wisdom\Nwhich I shall teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.68,0:05:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You must come to Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.56,0:05:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The arrow holds the key to his defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.92,0:06:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only way you can hope to prevail.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.36,0:06:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.50,0:06:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell do you get\Noff answering my phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.50,0:06:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That calls for me, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.66,0:06:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me that, you stupid brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.28,0:06:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.40,0:06:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, it's Deep speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.32,0:06:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's strange, Deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.86,0:06:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.36,0:06:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati's crew. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.64,0:06:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,One would imagine the loss of a dear\Ncomrade might addle their composures.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.28,0:06:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet oddly, not a trace of\Nhesitation haunts them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.38,0:06:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,They have now boarded a boat\Nwith a clear goal in their minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.82,0:06:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Investigate, return to Abakyo's\Nlast location, and look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.10,0:06:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.34,0:07:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do that, but what\Nam I supposed to look for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.42,0:07:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Fear is what arises from the\Nwomb of an unexpected past.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.84,0:07:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since I learned of my daughter,\NI have felt a sense of disquiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.74,0:07:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not seeing anything\Nout of the ordinary, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.72,0:07:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All they did was break the monument.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.20,0:07:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.48,0:07:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.16,0:07:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what they've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.02,0:07:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Those traitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.46,0:07:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They've found information I don't possess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.00,0:07:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But how can that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.60,0:07:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No way they could have learned\Nanything useful in such a rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.34,0:07:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is unimaginable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.70,0:07:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Dobio.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.02,0:07:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We must make our move now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.32,0:07:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I urgently need you to\Ntrack them down yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.66,0:07:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.40,0:07:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, have Cioccolata and Seko\Ncome join the pursuit as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.02,0:07:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I would have preferred not\Nto rely on those dregs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.52,0:07:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But alas, we won't need them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.62,0:07:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Dobio.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.74,0:08:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The only way to deal with\Nfear is to crush it into dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.34,0:08:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It is time for us to act.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.14,0:08:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We must triumph over our\Nfears once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.96,0:08:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That is what it means to be truly alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.78,0:08:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are we going all the\Nway to frickin' Rome for anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.52,0:08:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, can we even trust this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.50,0:08:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.41,0:08:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But Bucciarati said we're\Ngoing, so we're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.10,0:08:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What other choice do we have?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.90,0:08:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me share with you a\Nlittle piece of history.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.52,0:08:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,In Greenland lies a place called Cape\NYork, inhabited solely by the Inuit people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.64,0:08:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's known for being home to\Na massive meteorite crater,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.46,0:08:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,which came into being\Nthousands of years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.08,0:08:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, in 1978,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.18,0:08:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,while a team of surveyors were conducting\Na land resource survey of the crater,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.88,0:08:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,two of them were stricken\Nby a strange illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.52,0:08:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,In both cases,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.94,0:08:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,blisters began spreading\Nall over their bodies,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.42,0:09:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,breaking them down into unrecognizable\Npulps upon their deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.86,0:09:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But in one of those cases,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.00,0:09:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,the afflicted surveyor discharged a\Nbizarre spark of light from his fingertips,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.12,0:09:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,maiming several digits\Non his doctor's hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.00,0:09:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Subsequent investigations\Nrevealed that a mysterious virus,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.78,0:09:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,one many thousands of years old,\Nhad resided within the meteorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.82,0:09:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Scientists believe the two may have\Ncome into contact somewhere in space.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.08,0:09:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So there's a virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.84,0:09:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.00,0:09:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I've successfully tracked it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.54,0:09:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The arrow is made from the same material\Nas the meteorite from Cape York.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.04,0:09:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Centuries ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.36,0:09:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,a man who sought the\Npower of the gods learned
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.88,0:09:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,of this rock and used\Nit to create the arrows,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.02,0:09:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,one of which I have in my possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.84,0:09:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The behavior of this killer\Nvirus mimics natural selection,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.44,0:09:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,in that it propagates a\Ntype of viral evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.80,0:10:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Most who contract the\Nvirus do not survive,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.68,0:10:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,but the few that do seem to be\Nprotected by a specific trait.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.76,0:10:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And as if to reward this trait,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.44,0:10:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,the virus bestows upon its\Nhost a new biological ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.64,0:10:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain you need no evidence, as\Nyour bodies already know this to be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.72,0:10:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,so that's what stands are this is the root
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.00,0:10:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and the fundamental principle of the arrow
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.06,0:10:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,i see that now your\Nexplanations sound but you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.28,0:10:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,have yet to tell us\Nabout this secret method
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.28,0:10:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,of using the arrow why\Nwe must come to retrieve
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.88,0:10:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,it from you i cannot\Nreveal that to you until
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.84,0:10:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,you've come to meet me\Nin rome and i should
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.74,0:10:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,clarify only one of you\Nmay learn this secret
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.52,0:10:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,because it is imperative\Nthat no one else ever
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.48,0:10:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,comes to know of the true\Npower this arrow holds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.58,0:10:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But rest assured,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.42,0:10:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,whoever learns the truth of this item will
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.36,0:10:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,be instantly transported\Nto a new dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.44,0:11:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It is the only way you can hope\Nto destroy Emperor Crimson.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.12,0:11:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot affirm the truth of your words.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.52,0:11:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,However, if the boss learned of our\Nexchange, he would surely end your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.50,0:11:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.48,0:11:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Name your rendezvous point.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.68,0:11:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to the Colosseum in Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.38,0:11:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll know when you arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.26,0:11:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be there regardless of the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.88,0:11:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, all will be revealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.42,0:11:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.54,0:11:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your ass off of there, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.56,0:11:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.24,0:11:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to piss myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.86,0:11:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Like hell, you're gonna let go already!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.96,0:11:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This ain't the crapper!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.76,0:11:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over here, you shithead!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.00,0:12:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What a feeling!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.44,0:12:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.94,0:12:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's wait till those\Ndrunks leave and then duck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.84,0:12:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Right after which, we should obtain a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.30,0:12:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That should put us under\N45 minutes out of Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.98,0:12:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye aye, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.89,0:12:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, I'm sure that\Nwe'll make real good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.48,0:12:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Clouds are obscuring the moon, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.06,0:12:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.42,0:12:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a couple of them\Nnapping right over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.16,0:12:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.08,0:12:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,These guys cannot hold their liquor!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.20,0:12:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you're gonna get us in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.76,0:12:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.90,0:12:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I'm gonna do it,\Nand I'm gonna do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.14,0:12:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you there ain't no toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.20,0:12:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.54,0:12:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.45,0:12:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The problem is I can't reach my Papa now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.10,0:12:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm all the way up here, and it's\Nway down there trapped inside my zipper.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.40,0:13:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.00,0:13:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.50,0:13:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What just happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.76,0:13:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like there's a\Nstand on the loose. A stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.10,0:13:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's a freaking ambush.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.54,0:13:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.54,0:13:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, Seko.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.30,0:13:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember to keep a close\Neye on that battery level.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.34,0:13:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's very important to my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.60,0:13:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You know nothing irks\Nme more than finding out
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.80,0:13:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,the damn thing wasn't\Nrecording after the fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.88,0:13:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,so make sure it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.52,0:13:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.44,0:13:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Cioccolata, 34 years\Nold, former physician.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.64,0:13:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Two years ago, after a minor error\Nhad seemingly killed a patient,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.56,0:13:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,he was let go from the hospital\Nand picked up by Passione.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.44,0:14:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He had suffered a\Nhumiliating fall from grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.46,0:14:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,but the boss soon realized Chocolata's value\Nwhen the young doctor acquired a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.74,0:14:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It was not a mistake that had killed the\Npatient, but Chocolata's murderous motives.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.66,0:14:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He would purposely misdiagnose healthy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.70,0:14:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,individuals to get them\Non his operating table.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.80,0:14:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Part of his routine\Ninvolved reducing their
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.42,0:14:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,anesthesia so they would\Nwake up during surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.78,0:14:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Even as a child, he was\Nat the top of his class.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.96,0:14:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,At the age of 14, he decided to\Nbegin volunteering at nursing homes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.24,0:14:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Little did people know, however?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.26,0:14:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The teenager was administering unknown\Ndrugs to his elderly charges and also
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.26,0:14:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Your family tells me you're nothing but a
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.76,0:14:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,burden and they can't\Nstand the sight of you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.80,0:14:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Each day he'd whisper venomous lies
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.40,0:15:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Driving those in his care to suicide\Nsitting on his bookshelf at home were
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.00,0:15:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,25 tapes in which he had documented the\Nhorrified expressions of his victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.16,0:15:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Once he had claimed nine lives,\NCioccolata decided to become a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.58,0:15:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No activity brought him more ecstasy\Nthan observing death in action.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.16,0:15:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And being a physician allowed him\Nto watch the dying suffer up close.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.06,0:15:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,To see his victims decay in such vivid\Ndetail filled him with a sense of
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.56,0:15:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,superiority and made him feel as though\Nhe truly understood the mind of man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.50,0:15:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Chocolata's sole partner in\Nhis depravities was Seko.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.16,0:15:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Little is known of him beyond the fact\Nthat he was once Chocolata's patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.54,0:15:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Their chemistry led to an arrangement\Nwhere Seko only follows Chocolata's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.90,0:15:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And even among Pasione's many\Nvile-hearted stand-users,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.12,0:16:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,the wickedness of this\Nparticular duo stands out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.26,0:16:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So goes the story of Cioccolata and Seko.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.16,0:16:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's looking to me like they're currently\Nmaking their way toward Rome, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.12,0:16:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I just received word\Nthat they've arrived at
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.06,0:16:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,a fishing village pretty\Nclose to the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.80,0:16:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.14,0:16:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The task of stopping Bucciarati and his\Nmen will be left to Cioccolata and his dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.24,0:16:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But afterwards, it will be up to you to\Ncatch up to them as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.14,0:16:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you heard correctly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.42,0:16:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Rarely do I give in to revulsion,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.54,0:16:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,but for the other scum that is\NCioccolata, I make an exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.16,0:16:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I expect he'll reduce Rome\Nto rubble in his rampage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.54,0:16:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're worried he might go overboard?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.30,0:16:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm counting\Non you to intervene.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.54,0:16:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be the one to seize control.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.64,0:16:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two cannot be allowed\Nto know what Trish knows,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.76,0:16:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,nor can they ever find\Nout about what Bucciarati
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.56,0:17:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,and his band of fools\Nare looking for in Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.42,0:17:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the only one I'm\Nable to trust. Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.52,0:17:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You and you alone are my number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.02,0:17:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you down. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.58,0:17:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I live only to serve and defend you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.74,0:17:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for hogging the phone like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.96,0:17:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have it back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.64,0:17:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.92,0:17:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.82,0:17:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you touch, Mista?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.78,0:17:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's crawling all over you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.36,0:17:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I know as much as you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.66,0:17:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Just focus on finding the damn user!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.62,0:17:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't kick his ass\Nuntil you sniff him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.88,0:17:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Lil' bummer!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.66,0:17:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.57,0:17:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He's already massacred a\Nbunch of people at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.78,0:17:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He's about to mess up the entire village.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.56,0:17:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just indiscriminately\Nattacking civilians. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.98,0:17:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I can barely tell him apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.32,0:17:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This asshole isn't gonna be easy to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.08,0:17:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.36,0:17:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Report.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.27,0:17:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there's bubbly shit on my hand and I\Nhave no idea where the hell it came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.54,0:18:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like some weird mold that's\Nslowly eating away at my skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.92,0:18:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm beginning to think that\Nit's oozing out of my body.?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.62,0:18:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the same crap that\Ncame bursting out of
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.74,0:18:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,those other people and\Nturned them to slime.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.52,0:18:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I got some bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.06,0:18:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't be able to dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.46,0:18:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way we'll make it up\Nthe stairs to the parking lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.14,0:18:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All we can do is hop back on the\Nboat and try to get somewhere safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.34,0:18:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Any signs of breathing on shore?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.80,0:18:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't pick up anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.16,0:18:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Buterati.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.32,0:18:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't move until we've figured\Nout exactly what's attacking us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.34,0:18:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows what's going to happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.62,0:18:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going to happen is we'll get\Neaten alive if we keep standing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.00,0:18:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.90,0:18:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the stuff's getting all over me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.34,0:18:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.26,0:18:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the stuff coming from? It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.86,0:18:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.48,0:18:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, grab on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.40,0:18:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, do not stretch out your hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.70,0:18:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a trigger!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.66,0:19:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This stand relies on a very\Nspecific trigger to attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.12,0:19:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A specific... What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.86,0:19:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.80,0:19:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It started acting up the\Nsecond I lowered my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.22,0:19:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.50,0:19:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,the first time it attacked me was\Nwhen I reached down to grab my gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.92,0:19:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And it didn't get that drunk guy\Nuntil he jumped down the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.36,0:19:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The other guy had also\Nclimbed down the stairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.82,0:19:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,while the Rancho had to\Njump down to the boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.94,0:19:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So moving to a lower location is\Nwhat triggers this thing to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.24,0:19:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But, even so, at this rate,\Nyou guys are all gonna be...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.82,0:19:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He still won't descend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.22,0:19:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought he'd board the\Nboat to save his friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.40,0:19:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps he figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.46,0:19:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,My little trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.18,0:19:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Green tea's quirky secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.24,0:19:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This mold.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.24,0:19:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I've read about it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.62,0:20:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It starts by making a home\Ninside an insect's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.00,0:20:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,When the insect moves to a lower\Npoint, it spreads and kills its host.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.28,0:20:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called Entomophaga greely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.54,0:20:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The stand works in the same way,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.16,0:20:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,moving down from a higher\Nto a lower location.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.68,0:20:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what causes the\Nmold to act like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.82,0:20:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.16,0:20:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,For what reason would it behave this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.20,0:20:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Just think about it for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.86,0:20:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it gets its range.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.76,0:20:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It jumps from one body to another,\Njust like the fungus does.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.40,0:20:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,If the host moves even a little, the\Nstand's reach will drastically blow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.54,0:20:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what its user wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.88,0:20:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And the total behavior of a stand\Nis a reflection of its user's will.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.96,0:20:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia, get back on shore!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.68,0:20:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Climb out of the damn boat now! Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.78,0:20:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your ass over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.40,0:20:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, push!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.96,0:20:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,My foot just broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.74,0:20:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw the turtle, Narancia.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.40,0:20:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to aim it at Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.70,0:21:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect, Narancia.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.32,0:21:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.62,0:21:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Right where I want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.60,0:21:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Both you and the turtle are standing\Nexactly where I need you to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.98,0:21:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.00,0:21:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work, Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.44,0:21:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we keep moving upwards, we\Nshould ward off any further attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.88,0:21:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They made it back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.46,0:21:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They all managed to make it to shore,\Nand there wasn't even one casualty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.04,0:21:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.95,0:21:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm eager to know what's next.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.46,0:22:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They were accusing. Not always we were.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.72,0:22:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,knowing What is just fiction Or what is
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.78,0:22:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,the truth They have a mission They are
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.98,0:22:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The passion. But they\Ndare to tell us, what's?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.32,0:22:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,bad and what's good Stand up Join us Come
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.80,0:22:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,On, you'll see this.\NWe are the power. Cause
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.28,0:22:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,there's a future Cause we are the fighters
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.36,0:22:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Just fighting for the right. Let's go.
